# Everything here is created at runtime by main.py (see README §11). None of it
# belongs in the repository: the audio cache alone is ~12 GB and a single
# retained checkpoint is ~19 GB.

# The 16 kHz audio cache and the transient raw parquet shards.
data/

# Models, checkpoints, metrics, predictions, decode caches, logs and the
# directory lock. outputs*/ also covers the separate directories a smoke test or
# a hyperparameter sweep needs, since reusing one output directory across
# configurations is refused by the recipe guard.
outputs*/

# HF_HOME defaults to <repo>/.hf_cache so a small $HOME quota cannot break the
# 6.2 GB model download.
.hf_cache/

# W&B keeps its run files under VIMD_OUTPUT_DIR, but the wandb CLI writes ./wandb
# in whatever directory it is invoked from.
wandb/

# Python bytecode.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
